    <string name="settings_description_title">About the project</string>
    <string name="settings_description_body">MultiVPN is an Android client with a single interface for several VPN protocols at once: AmneziaWG, WireGuard, IKEv2/IPsec, L2TP/IPsec, OpenVPN, VLESS, and SSTP. Each protocol is a separate plugin built on top of an official or well-established open-source engine, with no protocol implementations written from scratch. Split tunneling (choosing specific apps), multiple profiles at once, detailed logging, and profile export/import are available wherever the specific protocol supports them.</string>
